  "worked_solution": "Three (or more) points are collinear if a straight line passes through all points.\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine our diagrams in turn. \n\n- Diagram I shows three collinear points. There is a straight line that passes through all three of these points.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14134102/assets/d0889441a43b73e2b1abd1c504974e755325977cc2d3c4cfd86777c6ded4d106.png)\n\n- Diagram II shows three points that are *not* collinear. We can't draw a straight line that passes through all three points.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14134102/assets/ead554eea443d790cfc642b2fc4c2c916829df373b701668c1f20b4b4299c369.png)\n\n- Diagram III shows three points that are *not* collinear. We can't draw a straight line that passes through all three points.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14134102/assets/9d8d988f789cf9bfd8b026d6cd48fcabf43abe70c294a4fe1617e5a959f51b86.png)\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only.\"",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"questionExplanation-154978\" class=\"questionExplanation\" style=\"display: block;\"><p>Three (or more) points are collinear if a straight line passes through all points.</p>\n<p>With that in mind, let's examine our diagrams in turn. </p>\n<ul>\n<li>Diagram I shows three collinear points. There is a straight line that passes through all three of these points. </li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"graphic-q-154978-e-0\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-154978-e-0\"></div>\n\n<ul>\n<li>Diagram II shows three points that are <em>not</em> collinear. We can't draw a straight line that passes through all three points.</li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"graphic-q-154978-e-1\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-154978-e-1\"></div>\n\n<ul>\n<li>Diagram III shows three points that are <em>not</em> collinear. We can't draw a straight line that passes through all three points. </li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"graphic-q-154978-e-2\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-154978-e-2\"></div>\n\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is \"I only.\"</p>\n<div class=\"studentAnswerHeader\">Your Answer:</div><div class=\"studentAnswer\">III only</div></div>",
